I and sorted into new lead, customer support or other. Each one is logged in your Google Sheet.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_34", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1926, "y": -122, "width": 352, "height": 250, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1460814403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504004732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_35", "type": "text", "x": 1948, "y": -106, "width": 308, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2133201996, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1959386987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - LEAD MANAGEMENT", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - LEAD MANAGEMENT", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_36", "type": "text", "x": 1948, "y": -71, "width": 308, "height": 49, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 295334610, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 401991736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A new lead gets a follow-up right away,\nwritten from what they asked, with your\nbooking link.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "A new lead gets a follow-up right away,\nwritten from what they asked, with your\nbooking link.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_37", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2478, "y": 58, "width": 352, "height": 250, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1159380354, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2036236842, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_38", "type": "text", "x": 2500, "y": 74, "width": 308, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 279172787, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260573196, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - CUSTOMER SUPPORT", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - CUSTOMER SUPPORT", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_39", "type": "text", "x": 2500, "y": 109, "width": 308, "height": 49, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1329753548, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1914012529, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A support question gets a drafted answer in\nGmail, and your team checks it and presses\nsend.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "A support question gets a drafted answer in\nGmail, and